{'symbol': 'NDAQ', 'date': '2022-10-28 02:30:00', 'title': 'NASDAQ LAUNCHES NASDAQ CUSTOM BASKET CALCULATION SERVICE IN COLLABORATION WITH S&P GLOBAL MARKET INTELLIGENCE', 'text': 'STOCKHOLM, SWEDEN, OCT. 28, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NASDAQ (NASDAQ: NDAQ) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF NASDAQ CUSTOM BASKET CALCULATION SERVICE (CBCS). THE INTRODUCTION OF CBCS TO THE MARKET IS DRIVEN BY THE INCREASING DEMAND FOR A SIMPLER AND MORE EFFICIENT WAY OF MANAGING PROPRIETARY INDEXES, THEMATIC BASKETS, AND ESG INVESTMENTS.'}